│ The issue arises because the sphinx-quickstart script incorrectly  │
│ rejects the Enter key as an invalid path. The script's validation  │
│ logic treats the Enter key as an empty string, which is not a      │
│ valid path. To fix this, we need to modify the validation logic to │
│ treat Enter as a valid path and allow the script to exit           │
│ gracefully.                                                        │
│                                                                    │
